{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37509","headline":"喜贺拔先辈衡阳除正字 · 周朴","name":"喜贺拔先辈衡阳除正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄纸晴空坠一缄，圣朝恩泽洗冤谗。\n李膺门客爲闲客，梅福官衔改旧衔。\n名自石渠书典籍，香从芸阁着衣衫。\n寰中不用忧天旱，霖雨看看属傅岩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}